Description: DSTerminal - Enterprise Security & Reconnaissance Suite
 DSTerminal is a comprehensive security and reconnaissance suite designed
 for penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, and system hardening.
 .
 Features:
  * System Hardening Dashboard with persistent state tracking
  * Exploit Vulnerability Scanner with CVE database
  * Network Reconnaissance Engine with real-time SOC dashboard
  * Automated patch management and verification
  * PDF and HTML report generation
  * Hacker-themed cinematic terminal interface
 .
 This package includes all necessary modules for enterprise security
 assessments and system hardening operations.
